  <name>JPEGView Linux</name>
  <summary>Fast, lightweight image viewer</summary>
  <description>
    <p>A fast native image viewer and editor forked from JPEGView, with responsive browsing,
    high-quality image rendering, and practical editing tools.</p>
    <p>Browse large image collections with responsive thumbnails, high-quality zoom and pan,
    crop and selection tools, live picture-level adjustments, and double-page reading. Supported
    images can also be opened directly from ZIP, TAR, 7z, and RAR archives.</p>
  </description>
  <developer_name>qusielle</developer_name>
